sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Customer Browser
  participant A as API Gateway
  participant L as Orders Lambda
  participant D as DynamoDB
  participant Q as Order Queue
  U->>A: POST /orders
  A->>L: invoke
  L->>D: put order
  D-->>L: ok
  par notify
    L-)Q: OrderCreated
  and respond
    L-->>A: 201
  end
  Note over L,D: Idempotency key prevents duplicates
  A-->>U: 201 Created
